OL,3,GNEWSAMy dying daughter gasped in pain
OL,4,Awhile medics argued at her bedside
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the days before her death,
OL,7,Fsix-year-old Flora Gentleman was in
OL,8,Fpain and visibly distressed. But
OL,9,Fbecause she was autistic and
OL,10,Fnon-verbal, she could not tell her
OL,11,Fparents what was wrong.
OL,13,FAfter four years of living with
OL,14,Fneuroblastoma, an aggressive form of
OL,15,Fcancer, Flora had stopped responding to
OL,16,Ftreatment. By December 2024 she was
OL,17,Freceiving palliative care at
OL,18,FEdinburgh's Royal Hospital for Children
OL,19,Fand Young People.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
