OL,3,GNEWSAMy dying daughter gasped in pain
OL,4,Awhile medics argued at her bedside
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite being given the highest
OL,7,Fpossible dose of pain relief, her
OL,8,Fmother, Stephanie Kent, said she could
OL,9,Fsee her daughter "gasping and wincing
OL,10,Fin pain".
OL,12,FAccording to Stephanie, disagreements
OL,13,Fbetween medical teams over how best to
OL,14,Fmanage Flora's symptoms erupted into a
OL,15,Fheated discussion at her daughter's
OL,16,Fbedside.
